{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_04D440","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"AI是Artificial Intelligence，也就是“人工智能”的缩写。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":70,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"指的是由人类创造、拥有与人类相当智能的机器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这种事……真的可能吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"你问可能不可能？你不是亲眼见过AI武器的性能吗。也见过继承了The Boss遗志的Peace Walker最后的选择。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":133,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"如果只是普通的<R=机器,MACHINE>，不可能选择自我牺牲。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=机器,MACHINE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"一堆电子零件竟然会拥有<R=意志,WILL>……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=意志,WILL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"“The Ghost in the Machine”……是存在的，Snake。灵魂真的会寄宿在机器里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":""}]}